  "source": "GXB S-7 (sigma_pool as noise_reading.py, its sigma_eval floor included; P1 section 3.3). sigma_eval,0 = the true prompt-clustered SE of a seed-matched a0-R pair: Gate B wave 0a's 1.28 pp (P1:179-180, the 1B pairing evidence; no 7-8B value exists before N); P = 200 harm prompts per cell (PR4:227)"
 },
